    prov:value "[{\"text\": \"[[ ## next_thought ## ]]\\nThe weather service timed out on the first attempt to get weather information for Lisbon. This appears to be a temporary service issue. I should retry the weather request to see if the service becomes available again.\\n\\n[[ ## next_tool_name ## ]]\\nget_weather\\n\\n[[ ## next_tool_args ## ]]\\n{\\\"city\\\": \\\"Lisbon\\\"}\\n\\n[[ ## completed ## ]]\", \"reasoning_content\": \"The user is asking me to continue the interaction. I need to look at the current state:\\n\\n1. The city is \\\"Lisbon\\\"\\n2. The trajectory shows that I tried to get weather for Lisbon but got a timeout error\\n3. I need to provide the next_thought, next_tool_name, and next_tool_args\\n\\nSince the weather service timed out, I should try again. The error was a timeout, so it might be a temporary issue. I should try calling get_weather again for Lisbon.\\n\\nLet me think about what to do:\\n- The weather service timed out on the first attempt\\n- This could be a temporary issue, so I should retry\\n- I should provide a thought about why I'm retrying\\n- I should call get_weather again with the same city\\n\\nI need to format this properly according to the instructions.\"}]" ;
