    prov:value "[{\"text\": \"[[ ## next_thought ## ]]\\nI have successfully retrieved the weather information for Lisbon. The second attempt to get the weather data was successful, returning \\\"Lisbon: 21 C, clear sky\\\". This provides the necessary information to produce the answer for the user.\\n\\n[[ ## next_tool_name ## ]]\\nfinish\\n\\n[[ ## next_tool_args ## ]]\\n{}\\n\\n[[ ## completed ## ]]\", \"reasoning_content\": \"The user is asking me to respond with the corresponding output fields based on the current state. Let me analyze what has happened:\\n\\n1. The initial request was to get weather information for Lisbon\\n2. The first attempt to get weather failed with a timeout error\\n3. The second attempt succeeded and returned: \\\"Lisbon: 21 C, clear sky\\\"\\n\\nNow I need to provide the next response with the proper format. Since I have successfully retrieved the weather information for Lisbon, I should finish the task and provide the answer.\\n\\nLooking at the instructions:\\n- I need to produce fields `answer` based on the `city` input\\n- The goal is to use tools to collect necessary information\\n- I have now successfully collected the weather information for Lisbon\\n- I should use the `finish` tool to mark the task as complete\\n\\nThe weather information I have is: \\\"Lisbon: 21 C, clear sky\\\"\\n\\nSo my answer should be this weather information.\\n\\nLet me format the response according to the required structure:\\n1. next_thought - reasoning about the current situation\\n2. next_tool_name - should be \\\"finish\\\" since I have the information\\n3. next_tool_args - empty dict for finish\\n4. completed marker\"}]" ;
